From: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Local: media: cedrus: expose VE load and stream counts

Measure execution from hardware triggers to validated completion IRQs.
Expose module sysfs statistics without idle sampling wakeups.

Signed-off-by: thor2002ro <thor2002ro@gmail.com>
---
